episode=45 instruction="Okay so head on down the hallway, and then go into the kitchen, and when you get to the island counter take a left, which puts you in the hallway, then take a right and you'll be in the dining room, just carry on through the dining room and into the living room, and stop next to the edge of the couch, behind the end table." start_position=[4.5338897705078125, 0.12711000442504883, -2.264050006866455] goal_position=[12.147899627685547, 0.12711000442504883, 4.2323198318481445] reference_geodesic=10.955527305603027
episode=45 prepared_subgoals=6
  [1] Walk down the hallway
      proof: The hallway ends at the kitchen doorway and the kitchen interior is visible ahead.
  [2] Enter the kitchen
      proof: The camera has crossed the kitchen threshold and the kitchen interior is central in the view.
  [3] Walk to the island counter
      proof: The island counter is beside or directly ahead of the camera, within a step; the camera has not yet turned left.
  [4] Turn left at the island counter, then turn right at the hallway junction, then enter the dining room
      proof: The camera has crossed the dining room threshold and the dining room interior is central in the view.
  [5] Walk into the living room
      proof: The camera has passed the dining room and the living room fills the view.
  [6] Stop beside the edge of the couch
      proof: The couch is directly ahead and the camera is beside its edge, behind the end table
